  "title": {
   "en": "Garaku Takara"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "がらくたから"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "An antique store in Nishiogikubo called “Kujyuku Shoten”. There lives a man, Fumi, who can no longer trust anyone because he was once betrayed by someone, and a mysterious boy, Mashiro.Mashiro is in fact a mourning god for the “water drop” stationery, and with his “ability to see the ‘memories’ of antiques,” the two solve the problems of people who come to the store.Today, too, the store receives items that have “something to say” about them.\n\nWelcome to the slightly mysterious and heartwarming world of antiques.",
   "ja": "西荻窪にある骨董品店「九十九商店」。そこでは、かつて人に裏切られた経験から誰も信用できなくなった男・史と、謎の少年・ましろが暮らしている。\nましろの正体は文房具「水滴」の付喪神であり、彼の「骨董品の“記憶”を視る能力」で二人は来店する人々の悩みを解決するのだった――。\n今日も店には“曰く付き”の品が持ち込まれる。\n少し不思議で、心あたたまるアンティークの世界へようこそ。"
  },
